  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/2n7h8edcr2_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个有点新意\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/2n7h8edcr2_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/2n7h8edcr2_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/2n7h8edcr2_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>一个耶鲁大学，一个30un30，两个人跑来抄这个小产品</div>\n<div>就没有其它可以做的了嘛</div>\n<div>真是没一点创意</div>\n<div>哦，那我不知道</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://gptshuntai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://gptshuntai.com/</a></div>\n<div>应该不是</div>\n<div>可能是前几天我们太高调了，报了流量</div>\n<div>给人感觉这东西很有潜力</div>\n<div>同一个需求，很多人做没啥，做的人不思考，只是简单复制，就有点偷懒了</div>\n<div>哈哈哈，这是按照收录数量来排吗</div>\n<div>这个 aicpb.com 是李秉宇搞的</div>\n<div>不加 www ，跳转到 <a href=\"https://dnipkggqxh.feishu.cn/wiki/YTIUwM6Vmij4IQkSm9PctPWunIb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://dnipkggqxh.feishu.cn/wiki/YTIUwM6Vmij4IQkSm9PctPWunIb</a></div>\n<div>全球首家\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/2n7h8edcr2_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>没有公开的，只有创作者能看到自己的</div>",
